<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission economic forecasts for Greece.</title>
<headline>EU Commission economic forecasts for Greece.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Greece, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 3.1	  3.3</p>
<p> Investment			 9.4	  8.9</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     6.0	  4.8</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	     8.9	  8.8</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  4.9	  3.4</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 108.3	104.9</p>
</text>
